# Example tasks file for `sandboxer run`.
# Format: [slug] on its own line, then the prompt (multi-line ok) until the next [slug].
# Lines starting with # are ignored.

[add-multiply]
Add a multiply(a, b) function to src/calc.js and a test in tests/calc.test.js.
Run `npm test`, get green tests.

[docs-api]
Add an "## API" section to README.md describing all exported functions from src/calc.js.
Don't change the code.

[validate-args]
Refactor add and subtract in src/calc.js: throw TypeError if an argument is not a number.
Add an error test. Run `npm test`, get green tests.
